IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-scope`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`

-- P3-art-20: Article 20 of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744): corrective actions and duty of information.
-- Lines 426-429 of the consolidated text. Unchanged by the Omnibus. Article 2(13) names Article 20 among the obligations whose application may be limited for an Article 6(1) system (the gate).
-- "immediately" is read as the same day: the clock of the rules counts whole days from the date asked (day 0, the day the provider considers or becomes aware), so an act on day 0 is in time and one on day 1 is not
-- (fork F-immediately in NOTES.md; the other reading is that no deadline is stated). The risk within the meaning of Article 79(1) and the certificate of Article 44 are plain BOOLEAN inputs, seams that PLAN.md section 4 does not list (its S11 is a different input, asked by Articles 80 to 83).
-- Reading a result: JUST TRUE met; JUST FALSE the duty applies and is not met; NOTHING not covered (the group does not yet apply, Art 2(13) may limit the Article, or the duty's trigger ("which consider or have
-- reason to consider", "Where ... presents a risk ... and the provider becomes aware") is absent: limited by its own wording).

DECLARE `Art 20 act` IS ONE OF
    `Art 20(1) take the necessary corrective actions to bring the high-risk AI system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate`
    `Art 20(1) inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers`
    `Art 20(2) investigate the causes of the risk, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable`
    `Art 20(2) inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body`

§ `Article 20(1): corrective actions "immediately" on considering that the system is not in conformity`

-- src:428 | 1. Providers of high-risk AI systems which consider or have reason to consider that a high-risk AI system that they have placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation shall immediately take the necessary corrective actions to bring that system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate. They shall inform the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers accordingly.
@ref Art 20(1) first sentence (src:428)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions to bring the system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 20(1) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Providers of high-risk AI systems which consider or have reason to consider that a high-risk AI system that they have placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation shall immediately take the necessary corrective actions" (the provider has no such reason)
        ELSE
             IF `the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions to bring the system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate`
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall immediately take the necessary corrective actions to bring that system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)

@ref Art 20(1) first sentence (src:428)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 20 act`
`Art 20(1) the provider's duty to take the necessary corrective actions immediately` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation`
    THEN PARTY Provider
         MUST `Art 20(1) take the necessary corrective actions to bring the high-risk AI system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate`
         WITHIN 0
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the necessary corrective actions were not taken immediately"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the provider has no reason to consider the system not in conformity
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)


-- "They shall inform the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers accordingly."
-- Each of the three "where applicable" recipients is required only where there is one.
-- src:428 | 1. Providers of high-risk AI systems which consider or have reason to consider that a high-risk AI system that they have placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation shall immediately take the necessary corrective actions to bring that system into conformity, to withdraw it, to disable it, or to recall it, as appropriate. They shall inform the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers accordingly.
@ref Art 20(1) second sentence (src:428)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there are deployers of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed the deployers` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is an authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed the authorised representative` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there are importers of the high-risk AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed the importers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 20(1) the provider has informed the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Providers of high-risk AI systems which consider or have reason to consider that a high-risk AI system ... is not in conformity with this Regulation ... shall inform the distributors" (the provider has no such reason)
        ELSE
             IF `the provider has informed the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned` AND ((NOT `there are deployers of the high-risk AI system`) OR `the provider has informed the deployers`) AND ((NOT `there is an authorised representative`) OR `the provider has informed the authorised representative`) AND ((NOT `there are importers of the high-risk AI system`) OR `the provider has informed the importers`)
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "They shall inform the distributors of the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers accordingly"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)

@ref Art 20(1) second sentence (src:428)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 20 act`
`Art 20(1) the provider's duty to inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the provider considers or has reason to consider that the high-risk AI system that it has placed on the market or put into service is not in conformity with this Regulation`
    THEN PARTY Provider
         MUST `Art 20(1) inform the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers`
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the distributors and, where applicable, the deployers, the authorised representative and importers were not informed"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the provider has no reason to consider the system not in conformity
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)


§ `Article 20(2): investigating the causes and informing the authorities "immediately" where the system presents a risk`

-- A seam PLAN.md section 4 does not list (its S11 is a different input): "presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)" is a fact stated by the caller (P8 decides it).
-- src:429 | 2. Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1) and the provider becomes aware of that risk, it shall immediately investigate the causes, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable, and inform the market surveillance authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the notified body that issued a certificate for that high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 44, in particular, of the nature of the non-compliance and of any relevant corrective action taken.
@ref Art 20(2) investigate (src:429)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider becomes aware of that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has investigated the causes of the risk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `there is a reporting deployer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has investigated in collaboration with the reporting deployer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 20(2) the provider has investigated the causes of the risk` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT (`the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` AND `the provider becomes aware of that risk`)
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1) and the provider becomes aware of that risk, it shall immediately investigate the causes" (no such risk, or the provider is not aware of it)
        ELSE
             IF `the provider has investigated the causes of the risk` AND ((NOT `there is a reporting deployer`) OR `the provider has investigated in collaboration with the reporting deployer`)
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it shall immediately investigate the causes, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)

@ref Art 20(2) investigate (src:429)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider becomes aware of that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 20 act`
`Art 20(2) the provider's duty to investigate the causes of the risk immediately` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` AND `the provider becomes aware of that risk`
    THEN PARTY Provider
         MUST `Art 20(2) investigate the causes of the risk, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable`
         WITHIN 0
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the causes of the risk were not investigated immediately"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the system presents no risk the provider is aware of
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)


-- src:429 | 2. Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1) and the provider becomes aware of that risk, it shall immediately investigate the causes, in collaboration with the reporting deployer, where applicable, and inform the market surveillance authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the notified body that issued a certificate for that high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 44, in particular, of the nature of the non-compliance and of any relevant corrective action taken.
@ref Art 20(2) inform (src:429)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider becomes aware of that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities competent for the high-risk AI system, in particular of the nature of the non-compliance and of any relevant corrective action taken` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a notified body issued a certificate for the high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 44` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider has informed that notified body` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 20(2) the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body` MEANS
    CONSIDER gate
    WHEN `Section 3 applies` THEN
        IF NOT (`the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` AND `the provider becomes aware of that risk`)
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1) and the provider becomes aware of that risk, it shall ... inform the market surveillance authorities" (no such risk, or the provider is not aware of it)
        ELSE
             IF `the provider has informed the market surveillance authorities competent for the high-risk AI system, in particular of the nature of the non-compliance and of any relevant corrective action taken` AND ((NOT `a notified body issued a certificate for the high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 44`) OR `the provider has informed that notified body`)
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it shall immediately ... inform the market surveillance authorities competent for the high-risk AI system concerned and, where applicable, the notified body that issued a certificate for that high-risk AI system in accordance with Article 44, in particular, of the nature of the non-compliance and of any relevant corrective action taken"
    OTHERWISE `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` gate
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)

@ref Art 20(2) inform (src:429)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the circumstances` IS A `Section 3 circumstances`
      `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider becomes aware of that risk` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Art 20 act`
`Art 20(2) the provider's duty to inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body immediately` MEANS
    IF `Section 3 the gate is open` gate AND `the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)` AND `the provider becomes aware of that risk`
    THEN PARTY Provider
         MUST `Art 20(2) inform the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body`
         WITHIN 0
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST BREACH BY Provider BECAUSE "the market surveillance authorities and, where applicable, the notified body were not informed immediately"
    ELSE FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the gate is shut, Art 2(2) cuts the Article off, or the system presents no risk the provider is aware of
    WHERE
        gate MEANS `Section 3 gate` `the date asked` `the AI system` `the circumstances` (`Article reference` OF 20, "", 0)

